WorldPanel.tsx

Replace every icon import with the project's icon library.

CharacterPanel.tsx

Currently uses:

lucide-react

Replace every icon with the equivalent icon from:

src/assets/icons/index.ts

After this refactor there should be no remaining imports from lucide-react or react-icons inside either component.

UI Requirements

The World Panel should:

support scrolling
support large lore entries
support images
support shop information
support related locations
support future interactive widgets
remain responsive on all supported resolutions

The layout should gracefully expand when objects contain additional information.

Performance

The panel should only render the currently selected atlas object.

Avoid loading unnecessary lore or related data until it is requested.

Large lore entries should be lazily rendered where appropriate.

