Acceptance Criteria

The implementation is complete when:

WorldPanel.tsx can render any atlas object using its associated schema without requiring object-specific UI code.
Only fields present in the selected object's schema are displayed.
Shops are fully supported, including inventory and service information.
Empty sections are never rendered.
Both WorldPanel.tsx and CharacterPanel.tsx exclusively use the project's centralized icon system (src/assets/icons/index.ts).
There are no remaining imports from lucide-react, react-icons, or any other external icon library in these components.
The panel is fully documented in docs/ui/WORLD_PANEL.md as the reference implementation for all future atlas and lore UI development.
